# Optional API mode for the canopi-studio skill. Copy to a gitignored file, e.g. .env.canopi-studio.
# Never commit a real token. CANOPI_AGENT_TOKEN is a cag_... value, shown once when minted.
#
# CANOPI_BASE is the API origin, e.g. https://staging.api.canopi.live (staging) or https://api.canopi.live.
#
# The token decides what API mode can do:
#   - minted WITH the `studio` scope ("Create Studio token" on Settings -> Agents, or
#     POST /v1/agents/:id/tokens {"scopes":["draft","studio"]}): acts for the human who minted it on /v1/studio:
#     list, pull, create, import, patch and run stages on their projects. Never delete. Capped per agent per hour:
#     20 stage runs, 60 other writes.
#   - any other agent token: reads as the agent's own account (the human's projects are 404, writes are 403);
#     use the project.json file round trip instead.
CANOPI_BASE=
CANOPI_AGENT_TOKEN=
